      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَمْسُوسٌ</span></b>  A man <i>in whom is a touch,</i> or <i>stroke,</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسٌّ</span>,) <i>of madness, insanity,</i> or <i>diabolical possession:</i> (S, TA:) or <i>mad, insane,</i> or <i>possessed by
a devil.</i> (AA, M, A, Mgh, K.)

